{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been summoned to a mysterious world, and your only path home is clear\u2014hunt down the giants, claim their amulets, and awaken the portal that brought you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may not be able to face these titans head-on, but you can gather materials to construct a walking fortress with cannons! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is\u2026 if the monsters of this land allow you to gather them in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful weapons and sturdy armor to endure this ancient realm, scarred by wars of a forgotten age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the secrets of this world and find your way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Walking fortress</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base to allow it to walk or even fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/220f3ecd4f58795031044613f84b7a45.poster.avif?t=1759016972\" width=590 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/220f3ecd4f58795031044613f84b7a45.webm?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/220f3ecd4f58795031044613f84b7a45.mp4?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Giant bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of these bosses can only be defeated with a base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/8b071e949ca20616771e90f94eac7087.poster.avif?t=1759016972\" width=590 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/8b071e949ca20616771e90f94eac7087.webm?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/8b071e949ca20616771e90f94eac7087.mp4?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to explore the vast world of Loya!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/4a3bc1fbf0d386bcf39c08470ca78913.poster.avif?t=1759016972\" width=588 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/4a3bc1fbf0d386bcf39c08470ca78913.webm?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/4a3bc1fbf0d386bcf39c08470ca78913.mp4?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Defenses</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add defenses to your base by placing towers that automatically attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/ea8dc388e53371441ef4f2b3a7af19a7.poster.avif?t=1759016972\" width=590 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/ea8dc388e53371441ef4f2b3a7af19a7.webm?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/ea8dc388e53371441ef4f2b3a7af19a7.mp4?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Building</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to make your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/9fa2d6bac7db38ec493e7963cfecb1b2.poster.avif?t=1759016972\" width=590 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/9fa2d6bac7db38ec493e7963cfecb1b2.webm?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/9fa2d6bac7db38ec493e7963cfecb1b2.mp4?t=1759016972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends in friend only games or join a dedicated server! The servers are optimized to handle up to 25 players! (It could handle more but I never tested it) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Other features</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with procedural rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high skillcap forge minigame</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets system (from Eggs)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2271150?t=1759016972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/99305e87284e15e13360df72660d1cbb69b4d40f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759016972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/8034beaf2b7f9db0487973ef879ada2afc4a9117/capsule_231x87.j